        "created_at": "2017-12-31T14:59:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Because the self damage clause doesn’t say “instead”, I would say it sounds like you still get the full normal effect in addition to the twist/self damage. Like, you’re firing off more than three grenades and one happens to land close to you.</p>",
